  "worked_solution": "In this case, the expression for $f(x)$ is a quotient $\\frac{u(x)}{v(x)}$ with $u(x)=\\operatorname{sech}\u20613x$ and $v(x)=x.$ \n\nTherefore, we apply the quotient rule as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}{f}^{\u2032}(x) & =\\frac{{u}^{\u2032}(x)\\cdot v(x)-u(x)\\cdot {v}^{\u2032}(x)}{[v(x)]^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{{(\\operatorname{sech}\u20613x)}^{\u2032}\\cdot x-\\operatorname{sech}\u20613x\\cdot {(x)}^{\u2032}}{(x)^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{-3x\\operatorname{sech}\u20613x\\operatorname{tanh}\u20613x-\\operatorname{sech}\u20613x}{{x}^{2}} \\\\  & =-\\frac{\\operatorname{sech}\u20613x(3x\\operatorname{tanh}\u20613x+1)}{{x}^{2}}\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$",
